{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Base directory for this skill: /Users/ben/github/toulmin/evals/toulmin/variants/ask-only/skills/toulmin\n\n# Writing the piece\n\nBefore you write, ask the user for what you are missing. Send one message with at most five questions, the most useful first. Ask only what would change the piece and what the request does not already answer. When the answers come back, write the piece as you normally would, and hand it over. When the user does not know something, write without it and do not guess.\n\n\nARGUMENTS: Sales page main text (~350 words) for a bookkeeper serving only hair and nail salons. Services: monthly books, payroll up to 10 staff, sales tax filing. Facts: 31 salon clients; 2 left last year, both sold their salons. $199/month (raised from $149 in January for everyone incl. existing clients). Books closed by the 10th of next month; missed 3 times last year. Last tax season 9 clients said their accountant charged less because books were clean; one saved $800. One person; no phone Sundays or Mondays. First call free, 20 minutes. End with a button to book the call."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"5dd5dd03-e350-466c-a89f-597807011e41","uuid":"96372b50-e9cd-4242-a6b5-e7ee595ca023","timestamp":"2026-11-16T20:26:09.165Z","isSynthetic":true}
